=== Array Comparison Tests ===

1. Simple regular arrays (equal):
   [1, 2, 3] == [1, 2, 3]: true
   [1, 2, 3] != [1, 2, 3]: false

2. Simple regular arrays (different values):
   [1, 2, 3] == [1, 2, 4]: false
   [1, 2, 3] != [1, 2, 4]: true

3. Simple regular arrays (different lengths):
   [1, 2, 3] == [1, 2]: false
   [1, 2, 3] != [1, 2]: true

4. Empty arrays:
   [] == []: true
   [] != []: false

5. Associative arrays (equal):
   ["a" => 1, "b" => 2, "c" => 3] == ["a" => 1, "b" => 2, "c" => 3]: true

6. Associative arrays (different values):
   ["a" => 1, "b" => 2] == ["a" => 1, "b" => 3]: false

7. Associative arrays (different keys):
   ["a" => 1, "b" => 2] == ["a" => 1, "c" => 2]: false

8. Nested arrays (equal):
   [[1, 2], [3, 4]] == [[1, 2], [3, 4]]: true

9. Nested arrays (different values):
   [[1, 2], [3, 4]] == [[1, 2], [3, 5]]: false

10. Deeply nested arrays:
   Deeply nested equal: true
   Deeply nested different: false

11. Mixed types in arrays:
   [1, "two", 3.0] == [1, "two", 3.0]: true
   [1, "two", 3.0] == [1, "two", 3.1]: false

12. Arrays with numeric keys (0-based):
   0-based arrays equal: true
   0-based arrays different: false

13. Comparison in conditional statements:
   (==) comparison in conditional: correct
   (!=) comparison in conditional: correct

=== All Comparison Tests Complete ===
